      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصطحبوا</span></b> , (S, A, K,) originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصتحبوا</span>,
(S,) <i>They associated, kept company,</i> or <i>consorted,
one with another;</i> (S, A, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصاحبوا</span></b> :
(A:) and in like manner <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصطحبا</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصاحبا</span></b> 
said of two men. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصطحبهُ</span>: see 1.

